<title>USA: Bugaboo Creek financial chief resigns.</title>
<headline>Bugaboo Creek financial chief resigns.</headline>
<dateline>EAST PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bugaboo Creek Steak House Inc said Thursday Chief Financial Officer Mark Peterson has resigned in light of the company's pending merger with Longhorn Steaks Inc.</p>
<p>The merger is scheduled to be completed September 13.</p>
<p>The company said Peterson will be joining Applebee's International Inc as vice president and controller in early September.</p>
<p>Bugaboo Creek said Anne Huemme, chief financial officer of Longhorn, will act as CFO for the combined companies.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
